    "A backdrop in the space's color behind everything; windows snap inside a thin frame next to the bar. Apps set to “Don't snap”, full-screen and fixed-size windows stay free. Frame width: Appearance tab.": {
      "extractionState": "stale"
    },
    "A backdrop in the workspace's color behind everything; windows snap inside a thin frame next to the bar. Apps set to “Don't snap”, full-screen and fixed-size windows stay free.": {},
