    },
    "A new folder with your data as JSON, your settings as a property list and all pins as a CSV table.": {},
    "A setup file sets up proDOCKtivity on another Mac in one go. setupNA (your settings, spaces and websites, no apps) is saved by itself after every change; setupWA also holds your apps and their rules. Logins, open tabs and ideas are never in it.": {
      "extractionState": "stale"
    },
    "A setup file sets up proDOCKtivity on another Mac in one go. setupNA (your settings, workspaces and websites, no apps) is saved by itself after every change; setupWA also holds your apps and their rules. Logins, open tabs and ideas are never in it.": {},
    "A website here is never closed (or after its own time), wherever it's open. Covers its subdomains too.": {},
