    "The app's first window snaps as usual; only further windows (like a new email) go here.": {},
    "The bar": {},
    "The bar always slides the way your fingers swipe. Normally two fingers to the left bring the next space (it slides in from the right). Turn this on for the other way round: two fingers to the right bring the next space (it slides in from the left).": {
      "extractionState": "stale"
    },
    "The bar always slides the way your fingers swipe. Normally two fingers to the left bring the next workspace (it slides in from the right). Turn this on for the other way round: two fingers to the right bring the next workspace (it slides in from the left).": {},
    "The icons at the top of the bar. A website's tab closes; the Favorite stays.": {},
    "The one in front goes left, the one you ⌥-clicked right. Clicking something else ends the split: only that shows. To keep one thing on a half while you switch the other, ⌃-click it (frozen on the left; ⌃-click again to release), or right-click → Freeze on the Left / Right.": {},
    "The one in front goes left, the one you ⌥-clicked right. To keep one thing on a half while you switch the other: right-click it in the bar → Freeze on the Left / Right.": {
