    "Windows you open from the bar fill the space beside it, on the bar's screen.": {},
    "With a second monitor: keep the bar on one screen and let the browser fill the other. If that screen isn't connected, the browser sits beside the bar as usual.": {},
    "With “only in the space”, an app belongs to the space that was open when you started it, and the space lists its open apps and tabs together. Drag an app onto another space's icon to move it there. Windows aren't hidden when you switch.": {
